","path":"style.css"},{"content":"# Cloud Cargo

Cloud Cargo is an original deterministic cargo-allocation practice puzzle. Select one crate and assign it to an airship bay. A manifest dispatches only when every crate is loaded and each bay exactly matches its visible mass target (and energy target on later manifests).

Keyboard: Left/Right choose a crate or bay; Space selects a crate or assigns it. Touch: tap a crate, then tap a bay. Three dispatched manifests complete the expedition; a run expires after 50 seconds.

Boards are generated deterministically from the session seed, with a valid hidden allocation used only to derive targets. Replay restarts the same seed for repeatable mastery. Device best is managed by the supplied local GameKit runtime.
